---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Opening from '../../../components/Opening.astro';
import Invite from '../../../components/Invite.astro';
import { path } from '../../../i18n/routes';
const L = 'en';
---
<Base
  lang={L}
  title="Services"
  description="GM Digital Bunker™ services for small and mid-sized companies: AI strategy and digital platform, and AI advisory by subscription."
  current="servicos"
  pageId="servicos"
>
  <Opening
    lang={L}
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: path('inicio', L) }, { label: 'Services' }]}
    eyebrow="Services"
    title="Senior strategy through to the finished artifact, with no team pyramid"
    lead="An independent AI technology strategy practice, from strategic analysis to the production of technical and communication artifacts."
  />

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="como-titulo">
    <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
    <h2 id="como-titulo" class="text" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">Whoever diagnoses is whoever delivers</h2>
    <div class="compare">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted" style="margin: 0;">Traditional consultancy</span>
        <div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>Partner</b><span>decides</span></div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>Manager</b><span>coordinates</span></div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>Consultants</b><span>analyze</span></div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>Analysts</b><span>research and produce</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top: 8px;">Leverage through people: the cost and lead time of an entire team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="border-color: var(--accent);">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="margin: 0;">GM Digital Bunker™</span>
        <div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>Senior</b><span>decides and validates</span></div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b aria-hidden="true"></b><span class="meta">directs ↓ &nbsp; proposes ↑</span></div>
          <div class="compare__tier"><b>AI under the senior's direction</b><span>research, curation, synthesis, writing, code, design and finished artifacts</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top: 8px;">Leverage through tools: a lean structure, with no pyramid cost.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-indigo" aria-labelledby="servicos-titulo">
    <div class="section container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The services</p>
      <h2 id="servicos-titulo" class="text" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">What the company can hire</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <a class="card" href={path('estrategia', L)}>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted" style="margin: 0;">Service</span>
          <span class="h4" style="font-size: 24px;">AI strategy and digital platform</span>
          <span class="small" style="flex: 1;">A tailored project, from diagnosis to a platform in production; Elite 90 Pro as the case.</span>
          <span class="more">See the service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href={path('conselho', L)}>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted" style="margin: 0;">Service</span>
          <span class="h4" style="font-size: 24px;">AI advisory by subscription</span>
          <span class="small" style="flex: 1;">Part-time AI executive: quarterly review, vendor screening and a cap on hours.</span>
          <span class="more">See the service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href={path('workshop', L)}>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted" style="margin: 0;">Service</span>
          <span class="h4" style="font-size: 24px;">“When it's Better with AI” workshop</span>
          <span class="small" style="flex: 1;">Team training in the book’s method: half a day, four modules, for any AI tool. Delivered in Portuguese.</span>
          <span class="more">See the service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="comecar-titulo">
    <p class="eyebrow">How to start</p>
    <h2 id="comecar-titulo" class="text" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">Three steps, from the conversation to the artifact</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="card"><span class="meta step__n">01</span><h3>Initial conversation</h3><p class="small">Understand where the business stands and where AI already shows up in its operations.</p></li>
      <li class="steps__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
      <li class="card"><span class="meta step__n">02</span><h3>Diagnosis</h3><p class="small">A closed scope, with decision criteria and priorities defined.</p></li>
      <li class="steps__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
      <li class="card"><span class="meta step__n">03</span><h3>Artifact project</h3><p class="small">Building what was decided, ready for the team to use: the AI-powered digital platform, built by us, and the documents that support the decisions.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <!-- "Formats, timelines and fees" is still to be defined; left out at launch, per the content doc -->

    <h2 class="text sub" style="margin-top: 80px;">Who it is for</h2>
    <dl class="criteria">
      <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>Mid-sized company (annual revenue of R$ 4.8 million to R$ 300 million) and growing small company</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Technology</dt><dd>No dedicated technology director (CIO or CTO); lean, outsourced or operational IT</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Decision-maker</dt><dd>CEO, partner or area director, who buys business results</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Moment</dt><dd>AI not yet adopted or already used by the team on its own, with no shared rule for deciding where and when to invest</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Expectation</dt><dd>A well-founded decision and something usable at the end of the project</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="meta" style="margin: 12px 0 0;">Size bands per the classification of BNDES, Brazil's development bank.</p>

    <h2 class="text sub" style="margin-top: 80px;">What GM Digital Bunker does not do</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">24-hour operations</h3><p class="small">Round-the-clock operations or monitoring of large IT environments call for another kind of supplier.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">Tool resale</h3><p class="small">No commercial ties to vendors: the recommendation starts from the business problem.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">Technology unrelated to AI</h3><p class="small">The practice works where artificial intelligence is the subject or is in the product.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">Third-party platforms</h3><p class="small">Deploying, configuring and maintaining third-party software is the vendor's responsibility.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">Technical training on tools</h3><p class="small">Training on each tool is the responsibility of its vendor.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4">Managing large engineering teams</h3><p class="small">Productivity metrics for development teams call for another kind of supplier.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Invite lang={L} />
</Base>
